{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"本港10月私樓樓價按月轉跌0.59%\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/PROP-RVD-261126-10.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】本港私人住宅樓價轉跌。</p><p>差餉物業估價署公布，10月私樓樓價指數報319，按月跌百分之0.59，按年升百分之8；樓價與2021年9月高位比較仍低接近兩成。</p><p>10月私人住宅租金指數報213.2，按月升百分之0.47。租金連升12個月，繼續創新高。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T03:50:41.417765+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T03:10:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:14:41.224314+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:44:11.560272+00:00","content_hash":"7cf9e5b42f5ed5be3a3853790253b0603b242f09164d6020968ba0d612d2f848","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}